{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../ip-port/", "title": "IpPort"}, "next": {"link": "../json-array/", "title": "JsonArray"}, "title": "IpPortSecret", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"ipportsecret\">\n<h1>IpPortSecret<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#ipportsecret\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.types.IpPortSecret\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">IpPortSecret</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.IpPortSecret\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API type.</p>\n<p>Constructor of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/ip-port/#pyrogram.raw.base.IpPort\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.IpPort\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">IpPort</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Details:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Layer: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">222</span></code></p></li>\n<li><p>ID: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">37982646</span></code></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>ipv4</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">32-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>port</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">32-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>secret</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["telegram/types/json-array", "JsonArray", "N", "next"], ["telegram/types/ip-port", "IpPort", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">IpPortSecret</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.IpPortSecret\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">IpPortSecret</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "telegram/types/ip-port-secret", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}